Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NGoto's sitting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[scoffs]\NThanks to him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.89,0:00:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I get to watch some\NS-ranks in action though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.14,0:00:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[MA DONGWOOK]\NWell...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-[grunts]\N-[cracking]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.11,0:00:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.15,0:00:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's kick this thing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:02:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.17,0:02:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]\N[thudding]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.08,0:02:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Testing our brute strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!\NNice and simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! You're about\Nto see size does matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.43,0:02:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[both grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.89,0:02:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[LIM TAE-GYU] I can't beat\Nspeedsters in close combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.61,0:02:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-[grunts]\N-[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.19,0:02:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you didn't know,\Nmy specialty is ranged attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.74,0:02:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[thudding]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.07,0:02:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoshino!\NWatch where you're goin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[hollering]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-[thuds]\N-[rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just checking,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but they have reinforced\Nthis place
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,with the highest quality\Nof essence stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-right, Chairman Go?\N-[laughs] Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.25,0:02:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking\Nwe may have to reevaluate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,how sturdy it really is,\Nthough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.13,0:02:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO] These guys\Nare the cream of the crop
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.84,0:02:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,among S-rank hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.72,0:02:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to approach\Nthis fight like
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.01,0:03:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,they're not just trying\Nto grab my wrists,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but to snap them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.98,0:03:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-[gasps]\N-[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.31,0:03:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO]\NAtsushi Kumamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.31,0:03:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem very aggressive\Nfor a combat type.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[deep breaths]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[KUMAMOTO]\NDamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not cut out\Nfor this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.41,0:03:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't have\Nthe heart for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO]\NIs Goto using us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing if his hunters\Nare ready to fight the ants?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the idea,\NI'm here for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.84,0:03:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.88,0:03:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm supposed to be\Na test, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to see\Nif you pass or fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.97,0:03:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[KUMAMOTO] Nope!\NI'm outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.51,0:03:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[PARK JONGSOO]\NWhatta buncha maniacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.77,0:03:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A little A-rank like me\Nwould get smoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! You're like the very\Ndefinition of pure grit
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.69,0:03:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and plenty tough, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-[thudding]\N-[rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[TANAKA] [scoffs]\NIn terms of physical strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:03:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.07,0:04:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought\NI'd be eating the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.95,0:04:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a humbling first for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[HOSHINO]\NI believe you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is running your only tactic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.17,0:04:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[rumbles]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.63,0:04:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're targeting me\Nover Hunter Cha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You must think\NI'm the weakest link.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.39,0:04:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[TAWATA]\NI can't predict her moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She's equal parts\Ngraceful and deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.27,0:04:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I see\Nwhy they call her the Dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's frighteningly accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[both grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA HAE-IN]\NI'd better help Hunter Baek.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.99,0:04:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[whooshing]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA HAE-IN]\NOh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I lashed out on reflex!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-[groans]\N-Aw, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he snapped again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[FUJISHIMA]\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means\Nall bets are off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think\Nwe should intervene?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if their lives\Naren't in danger, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA HAE-IN]\NHe's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-[grunts]\N-[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-[rumbling]\N-Okay, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.52,0:05:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.78,0:05:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.91,0:05:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NSorry to interrupt you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But this doesn't feel like
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,a friendly sparring\Nmatch anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.83,0:05:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[KUMAMOTO]\NWho the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He laid out Kumamoto\Nin his berserk state!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You said this one\Nis registered as a mage type?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.\NThat's what I heard, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[GOTO] Might have to confirm\Nthat myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Hunter Cha,\Nare you good to accept
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the loss for this match?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.81,0:05:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Hunter Baek\Nseems to have
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.31,0:05:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,tapped out as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.39,0:05:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA HAE-IN]\NSure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.98,0:05:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO]\NEven if I'd gone all out,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.61,0:05:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the result would've been\Nthe same.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[HANEKAWA]\NHunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.15,0:06:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're up for a round.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Guildmaster Goto\Nwould like to challenge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.16,0:06:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NHe's looking for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't need a translation\Nto know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been wanting\Nto try out the skills I got
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,from the Demon's Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the thought\Nof facing me funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.76,0:06:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Goto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Good news,\NHunter Sung's agreed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to spar with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,On one condition, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[GOTO]\NWhat's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll only fight\Nif you don't hold back on him,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.06,0:06:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.27,0:06:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Jeju Island raid\Ndraws closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.69,0:06:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and all eyes\Nare on the hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is waiting to see
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,if this alliance with Japan\Nwill be enough
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to tip the scales of victory...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[JOOHEE'S MOM]\NJoohee, dontcha got work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[JOOHEE]\NI'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.95,0:06:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Told ya yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.49,0:06:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[JOOHEE'S MOM]\NReally?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't slack too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.37,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta do our best,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.79,0:06:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,just like the hunters\Nout there are doin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.17,0:06:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[wind blowing]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.17,0:07:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[dial tone ringing]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.80,0:07:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I have questions about\Nthe Jeju raid's defense,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.43,0:07:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,if you have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[LIM TAE-GYU]\NWhat's happening now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess our renowned tenth\NS-rank is feelin' feisty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.23,0:07:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fixin' to go\Nhead-to-head with Goto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA HAE-IN] He held his own\Nin that A-rank dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.69,0:07:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but I wonder\Nhow he'll do against
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,an S-rank hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO] Surprised you don't\Nhave your handkerchief.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.53,0:07:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The smell of hunters\Nnot bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I can keep\Nmy nose covered
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,while I'm on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we stop this\Nbefore it starts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.46,0:07:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A spellcaster going up\Nagainst a melee hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,in close combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.21,0:07:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, I'd say\Nit's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.63,0:07:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But I bet I'm thinking\Nthe same thing you are
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,about this matchup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.47,0:07:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO] And I'm sure my hopes\Nare just as high.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.18,0:07:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if I'm right,\NHunter Sung has a rare ability
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep growing stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.73,0:07:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:07:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay. Let's...\N-[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[whooshing]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.11,0:08:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NCome on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[GOTO]\NHe's awfully nimble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.61,0:08:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And people think he's a mage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll expose you\Nfor what you really are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Oh, yeah,\Nhe's definitely a step above
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the other S-ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can still dodge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.05,0:08:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[GOTO]\NSmiling again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.01,0:08:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[LIM TAE-GYU] I'm goin'\Ncross-eyed trying to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's really hangin' in there,\Nisn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Evading such quick attacks\Nis very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA HAE-IN] It's not that\Nhe's "hanging in there,"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's egging him\Non to test his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.19,0:08:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[GOTO] This whole run around\Nthing is getting on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.41,0:08:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[thwacks]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.82,0:08:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-[thuds]\N-[rumbles]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:08:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.75,0:09:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful with that thing,\Nsomeone could've lost an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[GOTO] Is he toying with me\Nby grabbing my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[speaking in Japanese]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only guess\Nwhat you just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But grabbing your wrist\Nwould end the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.18,0:09:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And neither of us\Nwant it to be over so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.19,0:09:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our guildmaster's not playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate,\Nboth of them are gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,wind up getting\Nseriously injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[energy blazing]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.08,0:09:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[both grunt]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] [gasps]\NWhat the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.55,0:09:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung!\NThat's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Goto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This fight's getting\Nout of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's call it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're both in one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell your guild master\Nthis match is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:09:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.35,0:10:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO]\NDid I spoil your fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.23,0:10:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha. You fought the great\NRyuji Goto and lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.19,0:10:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All he managed to do\Nwas nick ya once!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.15,0:10:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Good on ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]I got a little\Nmore intense than I meant to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.49,0:10:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a good grasp\Nof everyone's skills now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sent soldiers into five\Nof their shadows, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUNHEE]\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, I'll send you\Nthe list of hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,participating in the raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.67,0:10:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[HANEKAWA]\NHm. And forward it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.05,0:10:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,to our vice guild master\Ntoo, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.05,0:10:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUNHEE]\NTake care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[car engine revving]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NChairman Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.31,0:10:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.19,0:10:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So about this Jeju Island raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.31,0:10:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.69,0:10:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[GOTO]\NReiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be shocked by how good
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.03,0:10:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,one of these hunters is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUGIMOTO] [laughs]\NI doubt he compares
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,to the guildmaster\Nof the Drawn Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:10:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[GOTO]\NDon't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.95,0:11:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUGIMOTO]\NWhich one is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the recently\Nreawakened S-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.\NOkay, that's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the list\Nfor the raid here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.17,0:11:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But his name's not on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he won't be\Njoining the raid after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.68,0:11:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,While it's a shame,\NI'm sure he has his reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.56,0:11:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.85,0:11:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO] Byung-gu's name\Nis missing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.94,0:11:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a solid team\Nof fifteen S-rank hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that are pledged to our cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This time's going\Nto be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, we'll win!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NYeah, about time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sweetie.\NDinner's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say your timing's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.09,0:11:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINAH]\NI'll just go by there later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Mom just woke up\Nfrom a four-year coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.01,0:12:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to Jeju Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.85,0:12:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[wind whooshing]\N[water burbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.73,0:12:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANT QUEEN]\NMy subjects need food,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but there is no prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They're cannibalizing\Neach other
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,to sustain themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.15,0:12:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We must leave the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.24,0:12:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I need stronger offspring,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,more powerful than any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Capable of leading
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-my mighty queendom.\N-[grumbles]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[clatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:13:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.57,0:13:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.37,0:13:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANT QUEEN] Grow strong,\Nmy son, for all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.33,0:13:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.67,0:13:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The ant magic beasts\Nhave been evolving
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.71,0:13:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,at a disturbing rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.30,0:13:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They only crawled along\Nthe ground
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,during the first three\NJeju Island raids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But as you can see
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.26,0:13:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,in this recently\Ncaptured footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They've taken a more\Nhumanoid appearance
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.85,0:13:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,in addition to growing\Nlarge wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In response...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.10,0:13:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hunter's Association\Nis formulating
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.15,0:13:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,a strategy to combat\Nthis newest threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.15,0:13:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.61,0:13:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOY 22B] You messed\Nwith the wrong S-rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you stupid beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a bad call\Nand you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.74,0:13:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Every hunter was called\Nto join the defense force,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,so why shouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Miss Han,\Nyou're an E-rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how it's gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.21,0:13:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOO JINHO]\NSorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.01,0:14:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[NEWSCASTER 3A] In the event\Nany rogue ants
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,make their way\Nto the mainland,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,hunters of all ranks\Nare being enlisted
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.43,0:14:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,as a countermeasure\Nto protect civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUNHEE]\NTonight, we rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.65,0:14:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, we raid Jeju Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[engines rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[OPERATOR 22A]\NThis is the first fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We've arrived\Nat our designated coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[OPERATOR 22B]\NSecond fleet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We've arrived as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[OPERATOR 22C] Third fleet\Nhas eyes on the island
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.41,0:14:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and is now approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.33,0:14:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[OPERATOR 22D]\NFourth fleet is also en route.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.21,0:14:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We anticipate arrival\Nin five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONTAE] Master, do we have\Nwhat it takes to beat the ants?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[JONGSOO] No way of knowin'\Nfor sure until we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But we were stationed\Nhere 'cause
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.93,0:14:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,we're usin' our smarts\Nto fight these things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.31,0:14:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No creepy-crawly's\Ngonna crawl past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.81,0:14:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're inspiring!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.31,0:14:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll follow you\Nfor the rest of my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.10,0:14:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,however long that might be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of things here,\NVice Guildmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.69,0:15:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm planning\Nto just space out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we'll be on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.11,0:15:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[DONGWOOK]\NAnything can happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, knowing\Nyou're on duty puts me at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.29,0:15:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can go into battle\Nwith a clear head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[VICE GUILDMASTER]\NPlease be careful, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.58,0:15:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-[DONGWOOK] Will do.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.38,0:15:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is Minsung\Nstationed up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.80,0:15:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know\Nhow much he's worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.09,0:15:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't have him\Ngetting eaten by ants!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.01,0:15:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him to hide in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.11,0:15:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINCHUL]\NAll squads have made contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The mainland force,\Nthe coastal guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.82,0:15:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and the team on Jeju.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.83,0:15:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The diversionary unit\Nhas landed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,on the island as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.16,0:15:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A heartening turnout.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:16:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So many hunters heard\Nthe call to arms
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and answered without question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.21,0:16:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Including,\Na very surprising yet
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.05,0:16:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,very welcome addition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.05,0:16:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready, how 'bout you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.18,0:16:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.35,0:16:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.06,0:16:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-[YOONHO] Byung-gu!\N-[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.98,0:16:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Could've sworn\Nyou said you were retired!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[BYUNG-GU]\NYeah, but then I realized,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.06,0:16:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,without a healer you'd be dead
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,in a matter of seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.11,0:16:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You see a magic beast\Nand charge straight in
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.53,0:16:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,without thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.44,0:16:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause if I didn't,\Nthey'd make a beeline for you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and tear you to shreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.41,0:16:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[scoffs]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.12,0:16:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.33,0:16:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[GOTO]\NIt's like a ghost town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.75,0:16:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha here.\NAll hunters, sound off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.21,0:16:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Bravo.\NIn position.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Charlie here.\NIn position.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Delta.\NWe're ready for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[helicopter whirring]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.51,0:16:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-[YOONHO] A live broadcast?\N-Yes. Well, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.60,0:16:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a ten-minute delay\Nto edit the intense scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.47,0:16:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As a cameraman,\Nit's a true honor to be
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:17:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,documenting this historic clash\Nfor the whole world to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO]\NSure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,When hunters have something
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,or someone to protect,\Nthey always up their game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.61,0:17:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, you do know being
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.74,0:17:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,behind that lens\Nwon't keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll be okay, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Though you wouldn't\Nguess it, I'm an A-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.24,0:17:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm used to filming\Nhazardous stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then, welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is prob'ly the first time\Nthe public will ever see
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.42,0:17:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,a raid like this,\Nbut it might also be the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, it had better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.55,0:17:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put a proper\Nend to this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.55,0:17:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO]\NIf we don't pull this off,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.59,0:17:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,our whole country could be\Nwiped from the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.51,0:17:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,More than ever, we need a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINCHUL]\NI just got word.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The strike team\Nis prepared to mobilize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.77,0:17:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.86,0:17:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.11,0:17:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the fourth Jeju Island\Nraid commence!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.94,0:17:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Release your full strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.61,0:17:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[ALL]\NRoger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[JONG-IN] The diversionary\Nunit is making its move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.41,0:17:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This bait is really\Nsomething else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.12,0:17:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There go the ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.62,0:18:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[ants buzzing]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just had to target\Nour transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.46,0:18:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[JONG-IN]\NPlease open the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.79,0:18:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[door whirring]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.09,0:18:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[flapping]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.97,0:18:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.68,0:18:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[blasts]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.51,0:18:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There are quite\Na few of these pests.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So brace yourself\Nfor some turbulence!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[blasts]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.32,0:18:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[JONG-IN] It's been\Na long time, Jeju Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.66,0:18:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hot damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our\NUltimate Weapon for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.58,0:18:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yessiree!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.12,0:18:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's touch down,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and then make our way\Ninto the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[helicopter whirring]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.05,0:18:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[DONGWOOK] The Japanese hunters\Nshould be able to distract
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,the ants for about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.72,0:18:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means,\Nwe have to get in,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,take down the queen,\Nand get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.85,0:18:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.14,0:19:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.85,0:19:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the moment of truth,\Neveryone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.35,0:19:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready the interference signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.65,0:19:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,On my mark, activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.57,0:19:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Transmitting now, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[static sound]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUGIMOTO] Good luck having\Nyour minions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,detect a distress\Nsignal now, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.24,0:19:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-[grunts]\N-[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep flinching,\Nand you'll wind up dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.46,0:19:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why even wait around\Nfor them to execute the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.05,0:19:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be a lot faster
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.38,0:19:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,if we just killed off\Nall the ants instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.80,0:19:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe. We could.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-[screams]\N-Let's approach it like Kenzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-He's having a field day.\N-[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.56,0:19:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[KEI] Where there's smoke,\Nthere's fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.39,0:19:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet it's that Che,\Ner, Choi guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.93,0:19:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[KEI] If he and I fought,\Ndo you think I could take him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire versus ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.86,0:19:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How original.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.32,0:19:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[JONG-IN]\NThe nest is secured.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not waste a single\Nsecond they buy us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.49,0:19:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO] That's a lot\Nof tunnels to choose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Question is, which one of them\Nis gonna lead us to the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.83,0:20:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[wind gusting]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.54,0:20:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[fires]\N[explosions]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a little\Nwarning next time, Jong-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.21,0:20:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[JONG-IN] We don't have time\Nto search them all
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and we can't divide\Nand conquer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we're after the tunnel
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.55,0:20:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,that leads the deepest\Nunderground.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.10,0:20:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe\Nthat's the one we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.73,0:20:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the last\Nof the daily quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda eerie\Nhow no one's around today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.36,0:20:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They formed two teams\Nof S-ranks,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.32,0:20:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and every member is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be an easy victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Even without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[firing]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[BYUNG-GU] Are we sure\Nthe queen is down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.88,0:20:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She might've abandoned\Nthem to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.05,0:20:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO]\NIt's an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.09,0:20:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere she could go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter Cha and I\Nfound something up this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.01,0:21:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.60,0:21:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[BYUNG-GU]\NIt's an egg chamber!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[JONG-IN] So the queen's\Nchamber should be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.65,0:21:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.65,0:21:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If the queen laid that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.82,0:21:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,what kind of thing was inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.24,0:21:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, whatever hatched\Nfrom that egg
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't what our team\Ncame here to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.03,0:21:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on the queen ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONHO] I say that,\Nbut it's unsettling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.99,0:21:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They keep on evolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.75,0:21:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And if there's an ant\Nout there
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,that was born from an egg\Nof this size...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.55,0:21:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.96,0:21:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,These shitheads mean war.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.55,0:21:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Got munched pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me\Nto patch you up there, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta pay the price, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.89,0:21:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[TANAKA]\NQuit being a screwy brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.85,0:21:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but there's\Nsomething that I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And, no, it isn't money\Nthis time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.89,0:21:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-I...\N-[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.27,0:21:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,More incoming.\NFine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.27,0:21:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Shimizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.86,0:21:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you want, just--\N[gasps]
